{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"哥林多後書","commonName":"哥林多後書","title":"哥林多後書","order":47,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"a604231fbbea35edac5846ad421a3341b06e5df55de9ee83d42c78413669680e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":257},"chapter":{"number":9,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["幫助聖徒的捐款"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["論到供給聖徒的事，我不必寫信給你們；"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因為我知道你們樂意的心，常對馬其頓人誇獎你們，說亞該亞人預備好了，已經有一年了；並且你們的熱心激動了許多人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["但我打發那幾位弟兄去，要叫你們照我的話預備妥當，免得我們在這事上誇獎你們的話落了空。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["萬一有馬其頓人與我同去，見你們沒有預備，就叫我們所確信的，反成了羞愧；你們羞愧，更不用說了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["因此，我想不得不求那幾位弟兄先到你們那裏去，把從前所應許的捐資預備妥當，就顯出你們所捐的是出於樂意，不是出於勉強。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「少種的少收，多種的多收」，這話是真的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["各人要隨本心所酌定的，不要作難，不要勉強，因為捐得樂意的人是上帝所喜愛的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["上帝能將各樣的恩惠多多地加給你們，使你們凡事常常充足，能多行各樣善事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["如經上所記：",{"text":"他施捨錢財，賙濟貧窮；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的仁義存到永遠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["那賜種給撒種的，賜糧給人吃的，必多多加給你們種地的種子，又增添你們仁義的果子；"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["叫你們凡事富足，可以多多施捨，就藉着我們使感謝歸於上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["因為辦這供給的事，不但補聖徒的缺乏，而且叫許多人越發感謝上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他們從這供給的事上得了憑據，知道你們承認基督順服他的福音，多多地捐錢給他們和眾人，便將榮耀歸與上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他們也因上帝極大的恩賜顯在你們心裏，就切切地想念你們，為你們祈禱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["感謝上帝，因他有說不盡的恩賜！"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/9.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/10.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/8.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}